ive care", "description": "Promote health without reinforcing weight bias or disordered eating.", "children": [{"id": "e8297ae9-f5c2-4288-8d5c-2a1d6042212a", "type": "concept", "title": "Weight-neutral communication and growth privacy"}, {"id": "1f2e8839-d62d-49a8-8156-5d2c1a016cc4", "type": "concept", "title": "Anti-diet literacy and media influence"}, {"id": "3870a91f-0958-45de-8d69-c0609b80fa6a", "type": "concept", "title": "Eating-disorder warning signs, bullying, and referral pathways"}]}]}, {"id": "c0dd3639-e6eb-459a-9f0b-eb01991c15ef", "type": "topic", "title": "Adolescent Nutrition and Transition to Adulthood", "description": "Addresses puberty, peak bone and lean-mass accrual, growing independence, sport, sleep, substance exposure, and heightened vulnerability to disordered eating.", "children": [{"id": "c60950d3-d8dd-4cb5-81cd-43aad5a33cdd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Puberty and requirements", "description": "Relate maturation and growth velocity to changing needs.", "children": [{"id": "0f7de155-8bd4-4af4-bf13-0be313ee5ea3", "type": "concept", "title": "Energy and protein variability"}, {"id": "a2b375d7-d62f-4110-889b-4172d6afcc90", "type": "concept", "title": "Iron, calcium, vitamin D, folate, zinc, and B12"}, {"id": "3bee969c-3cc0-41f4-ad90-eda9f4a90872", "type": "concept", "title": "Menstruation, bone accrual, and developmental timing"}]}, {"id": "f5afd6d7-85df-4fa8-bd92-b0563d5de5b4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Autonomy and environment", "description": "Support practical choices across school, work, peers, culture, and digital media.", "children": [{"id": "4a9788d7-1524-4b68-908c-f9ee257d374b", "type": "concept", "title": "Meal patterns, convenience foods, caffeine, and sugary drinks"}, {"id": "85d99668-6806-48d4-bc88-16eb0fc1439f", "type": "concept", "title": "Vegetarian/vegan diets and supplement oversight"}, {"id": "05c2e0b6-724f-47dd-80a6-716868e590b3", "type": "concept", "title": "Food skills, budgeting, and transition to independent living"}]}, {"id": "d8c7544c-b029-44c6-87c4-27286c3de01c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk and protective factors", "description": "Screen sensitively and refer early when health or safety is threatened.", "children": [{"id": "dbfc40c8-9a08-4a7d-9335-78373ccc8437", "type": "concept", "title": "Eating disorders, low energy availability, and body-image distress"}, {"id": "0de6e062-a7b6-4b80-833a-960b18223cdb", "type": "concept", "title": "Substance use, pregnancy, chronic disease, and medication interactions"}, {"id": "0931ef49-c300-4710-addf-b019de644a38", "type": "concept", "title": "Confidentiality, consent, family involvement, and transition care"}]}]}, {"id": "42f5774c-fd9a-4d21-b474-3b94f27ef1b4", "type": "topic", "title": "Adult Nutrition and Cardiometabolic Health", "description": "Uses adulthood to integrate dietary patterns, work and family demands, reproductive transitions, chronic-disease prevention, and sustainable habits rather than one-size-fits-all prescriptions.", "children": [{"id": "d853da0e-9f4d-44fd-84a7-25d2ff8ba561", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Dietary patterns and prevention", "description": "Evaluate whole-pattern evidence for long-term health.", "children": [{"id": "9c24fdac-6eee-44f8-80ee-c4a87f216f98", "type": "concept", "title": "Cardiovascular, metabolic, gastrointestinal, and cancer-prevention evidence"}, {"id": "6fb17ffe-ef8c-458b-816b-7565f8f0c4df", "type": "concept", "title": "Fiber, fats, sodium, potassium, added sugars, alcohol, and food processing"}, {"id": "903cf1da-57f4-45cc-a944-1147c2b00e64", "type": "concept", "title": "Plant-forward patterns, cultural foods, and nutrient adequacy"}]}, {"id": "5f137cd0-c9c6-40a1-b08a-ff085c9bb01f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Life context", "description": "Adapt recommendations to time, income, caregiving, shift work, and access.", "children": [{"id": "990768e2-b4b0-4576-8a95-76df106e9775", "type": "concept", "title": "Meal planning, food skills, eating away from home, and convenience"}, {"id": "8aed1152-efec-42f1-b665-567521feda46", "type": "concept", "title": "Sleep, stress, physical activity, and social connection"}, {"id": "38349a51-9b96-4cdc-a4e0-7abec8f0a05e", "type": "concept", "title": "Food insecurity, workplace food, and structural determinants"}]}, {"id": "29c4b043-01ca-447a-a40f-8b2ee4f03169", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Individualization and referral", "description": "Recognize when general wellness advice is insufficient.", "children": [{"id": "18d0ed7b-ad2d-4eac-b0a5-5a28003ba3eb", "type": "concept", "title": "Pregnancy planning, chronic conditions, medications, and surgery"}, {"id": "d12ed6eb-67cf-43b9-a6c7-1c2556d26843", "type": "concept", "title": "GI symptoms, allergies, eating disorders, and unintentional change"}, {"id": "7a9342fa-4515-471b-8a6e-b0bd6d8ad213", "type": "concept", "title": "Scope of practice and medical nutrition therapy referral"}]}]}, {"id": "9f832845-923f-4253-ba14-7a148b0bba4c", "type": "topic", "title": "Midlife, Menopause, and Healthy Aging Transitions", "description": "Treats midlife as a distinct transition involving hormonal, metabolic, skeletal, cardiovascular, occupational, and caregiving changes rather than a simple extension of early adulthood.", "children": [{"id": "ca9b0aee-2d2b-45d8-9d6f-2eb3a770b89c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Menopause and midlife change", "description": "Interpret changing body composition and symptoms without weight stigma.", "children": [{"id": "379bfaf1-233a-40ac-ac0e-5cd8a54b4946", "type": "concept", "title": "Menopause transition, sleep, vasomotor symptoms, and evidence limits"}, {"id": "cdcc9b6f-c766-482f-8bbb-6f718d78a764", "type": "concept", "title": "Bone, muscle, cardiovascular, and metabolic health"}, {"id": "4bcdfd86-0dc7-40b5-89f8-4b3f01a38983", "type": "concept", "title": "Calcium, vitamin D, protein, fiber, and alcohol considerations"}]}, {"id": "744f3538-c522-4bee-9e66-f4a22cedf0fe", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Health maintenance", "description": "Prioritize risk reduction and function.", "children": [{"id": "c00b0610-2544-4c97-8e05-34213a9ce1e5", "type": "concept", "title": "Strength and aerobic activity"}, {"id": "5884fca2-3569-40a9-b085-99177843739b", "type": "concept", "title": "Blood pressure, lipids, glycemia, and screening context"}, {"id": "2548c2fb-d100-4631-825f-34ca06d535e4", "type": "concept", "title": "Dental, GI, and medication-related issues"}]}, {"id": "841c6b9e-cd95-4497-b6fe-bbb7b04ece0a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Social context", "description": "Address caregiving, employment, culture, and changing household structure.", "children": [{"id": "2a7dfa18-9403-4258-8fd0-2e5b8f9752ea", "type": "concept", "title": "Time scarcity and sandwich-generation demands"}, {"id": "95f31ac8-6c52-4fff-99fb-e47b0bbf97b8", "type": "concept", "title": "Food access, menopause misinformation, and supplement marketing"}, {"id": "2c25dcf1-d3fa-4d48-9da3-96802c59e344", "type": "concept", "title": "Shared decision-making and referral for persistent symptoms"}]}]}, {"id": "d5debde7-538e-47f7-834e-c8567560092d", "type": "topic", "title": "Older Adult Nutrition, Function, and Frailty Prevention", "description": "Centers function, independence, enjoyment, and quality of life. Students assess undernutrition, sarcopenia, dehydration, oral health, cognition, medications, and care environments alongside chronic disease.", "children": [{"id": "ad632faa-6d57-4dce-acf9-cc3cb71ce90c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Physiology and requirements", "description": "Connect aging changes with altered intake and nutrient needs.", "children": [{"id": "fdf1ff91-1942-4c54-ab74-385262f259ca", "type": "concept", "title": "Appetite, taste/smell, gastric and renal changes"}, {"id": "d3284565-4343-45f7-936a-004b001ecc11", "type": "concept", "title": "Protein distribution, energy, fluids, calcium, vitamin D, B12, and fiber"}, {"id": "e9ae2849-3a52-4b9e-9b17-de4198207ac5", "type": "concept", "title": "Sarcopenia, osteoporosis, frailty, and recovery"}]}, {"id": "19be4b67-24ef-4940-a0aa-91084f75adb7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk assessment", "description": "Identify reversible contributors to malnutrition and functional decline.", "children": [{"id": "1fa7a4f6-e1b7-4218-ac6a-509a30ab6539", "type": "concept", "title": "Weight loss, reduced intake, swallowing, dental, and GI concerns"}, {"id": "69479612-26fc-4cdd-80b5-8936e040c959", "type": "concept", "title": "Polypharmacy, cognition, depression, mobility, and social isolation"}, {"id": "0fcf3e67-d353-42dc-b127-d207855ec214", "type": "concept", "title": "Screening tools, nutrition-focused examination, and referral"}]}, {"id": "20f7130b-57bd-4300-ac14-713e5f79e599", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Care settings and goals", "description": "Balance disease management with preferences, comfort, and feasibility.", "children": [{"id": "2d137478-466e-441d-b328-8490a0a50d16", "type": "concept", "title": "Community living, home care, assisted living, and long-term care"}, {"id": "7b4878f6-1bf4-4d9f-ad23-d8e426dd3854", "type": "concept", "title": "Texture modification and swallowing-team collaboration"}, {"id": "f8134ae8-a4cf-49db-a697-55253e04188e", "type": "concept", "title": "Dementia, palliative goals, autonomy, and ethical feeding decisions"}]}]}, {"id": "00f1ab94-866c-48b1-9893-cf40299c9af0", "type": "topic", "title": "Physical Activity and Sport Across the Lifespan", "description": "Integrates fueling, hydration, recovery, adaptation, and safety across recreational activity, competitive sport, pregnancy, adolescence, adulthood, and aging.", "children": [{"id": "71cba2ca-35ad-4029-bddf-af0f80cb6426", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Energy and fueling", "description": "Match intake to activity type, duration, intensity, and training phase.", "children": [{"id": "359240c9-8f36-4311-b8fe-7dd6c82b3689", "type": "concept", "title": "Carbohydrate availability and periodization"}, {"id": "7a15e706-7c22-436b-810e-f56775ab7144", "type": "concept", "title": "Protein dose, distribution, and recovery"}, {"id": "cb75c8c1-36d9-44ad-9395-3ff2f42cb1fb", "type": "concept", "title": "Fat, micronutrients, and energy availability"}]}, {"id": "cef8f856-7417-42f5-ab73-495c3c78f4f2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Hydration and environment", "description": "Plan fluids and electrolytes based on individual losses and conditions.", "children": [{"id": "a0433e1a-b726-40c9-87e7-d9ae6c117b73", "type": "concept", "title": "Sweat rate and hydration assessment"}, {"id": "3f4bc390-1dac-420a-a075-061c3ec7f098", "type": "concept", "title": "Heat, cold, altitude, and travel"}, {"id": "304e8190-a2bd-4d88-bdfe-92d47d637c04", "type": "concept", "title": "Hyponatremia and dehydration risk"}]}, {"id": "3731b81e-2e72-425e-a63c-c6577e91c364", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Lifecycle and safety", "description": "Adapt sport nutrition to growth, reproductive health, chronic conditions, and aging.", "children": [{"id": "63d5e4b9-39c2-4b8d-8131-4beb08f378ad", "type": "concept", "title": "Youth athletes and growth"}, {"id": "97c98278-2b96-4d11-99d8-dff28e8f7126", "type": "concept", "title": "Pregnancy/postpartum activity and older-adult training"}, {"id": "c648442b-c262-4cc2-970a-3bc5f850d716", "type": "concept", "title": "REDs, eating disorders, supplements, contamination, and referral"}]}]}, {"id": "49a15705-d871-4004-9de7-6186a0f41cf4", "type": "topic", "title": "Food Security, Culture, Disability, and Population Context", "description": "Examines why nutrient needs cannot be separated from access, culture, disability, discrimination, environment, policy, and global context. Students practice culturally humble and structurally informed care.", "children": [{"id": "92780eac-eb54-451a-88b0-44c54376d0b6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Food and nutrition security", "description": "Assess access and resources without blame.", "children": [{"id": "b87133ee-7b4c-4a42-b68b-9ba2af687529", "type": "concept", "title": "Household food insecurity screening and referral"}, {"id": "054b10ec-e9fb-41c1-a8ba-9aba7e7ffb13", "type": "concept", "title": "WIC, school meals, SNAP, congregate meals, and community programs"}, {"id": "ed3d2a86-9808-4c3d-8c41-fe89d3d290f1", "type": "concept", "title": "Transportation, housing, utilities, and rural/remote access"}]}, {"id": "b0dbfec7-07fc-4246-b667-6701d60e190f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Culture and identity", "description": "Treat cultural foodways as assets and avoid stereotyping.", "children": [{"id": "7c034a23-c177-482d-bb05-a7176dca38b3", "type": "concept", "title": "Cultural humility, language access, and shared decision-making"}, {"id": "24147c22-36e9-455b-90e2-92c06af1adc6", "type": "concept", "title": "Religious practices, migration, Indigenous food systems, and acculturation"}, {"id": "36345afa-2389-41e7-86d9-f06f5a49fa94", "type": "concept", "title": "Family roles, gender diversity, and inclusive reproductive language"}]}, {"id": "bfa328c9-eb86-4e77-83de-edfd412556a3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Disability-inclusive nutrition", "description": "Adapt assessment and interventions to function, communication, and support needs.", "children": [{"id": "561e4840-5e0b-4c10-928a-7482441d4872", "type": "concept", "title": "Sensory, motor, cognitive, and communication access"}, {"id": "290e268f-44e8-43b2-b0c7-66f72c981a2c", "type": "concept", "title": "Adaptive equipment, texture, feeding assistance, and autonomy"}, {"id": "972264e3-ceab-4813-819a-615b5f0f8abd", "type": "concept", "title": "Neurodiversity, selective eating, and interdisciplinary feeding care"}]}]}, {"id": "dffcf9b7-264c-43bd-9b0d-3188ccf023f4", "type": "topic", "title": "Lifecycle Meal Planning, Counseling, and Care Integration", "description": "Brings the course together through realistic meal planning, counseling, documentation, and referral. Plans must be nutritionally sound, culturally acceptable, affordable, safe, and workable in the person's actual life.", "children": [{"id": "03080968-a3b4-4166-90fc-4c7b41a43a34", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Meal planning process", "description": "Translate requirements and assessment findings into flexible food patterns.", "children": [{"id": "1b575bfd-1cdb-471f-a121-5a9fe25be953", "type": "concept", "title": "Food-first planning, fortification, supplements, and nutrient analysis"}, {"id": "39832792-2da1-4e5a-8c9a-e0d32b8b6ff6", "type": "concept", "title": "Budget, time, equipment, availability, and food safety"}, {"id": "7afaac18-579f-434c-9039-1c18daa3afc5", "type": "concept", "title": "Menus for families with multiple lifecycle needs"}]}, {"id": "a23d093a-b3c2-4423-b7cb-d1cd3bb40ec3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Counseling and education", "description": "Use developmentally appropriate, respectful communication.", "children": [{"id": "b31dc79c-5479-4c2b-9007-a7038c66df44", "type": "concept", "title": "Motivational interviewing and shared goals"}, {"id": "efee5ad7-42fa-4a5b-b4ed-4317d8d8c5ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Health literacy, teach-back, visuals, and interpreter use"}, {"id": "bd1459ef-f980-4ff2-9ea3-72a402a9233c", "type": "concept", "title": "Responsive feeding, weight-neutral care, and misinformation correction"}]}, {"id": "6705325e-e473-4c2c-bc4f-344815536a8a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Care coordination and evaluation", "description": "Document reasoning, monitor outcomes, and escalate concerns.", "children": [{"id": "ab1471c2-ae65-47ab-9983-8b1e4b1e3c20", "type": "concept", "title": "Nutrition diagnosis language and care-plan logic"}, {"id": "1b561a6b-2a21-4f2f-b8b8-5c3ea4a17947", "type": "concept", "title": "Outcome measures, follow-up, adherence barriers, and plan revision"}, {"id": "a27b5c19-ee73-4670-8f33-b5b7fd5b2d9f", "type": "concept", "title": "Interprofessional roles, referral red flags, and continuity across transitions"}]}, {"id": "da90dda6-64e5-4016-b6a5-00058d6a4b34", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sustainability and ethics", "description": "Consider environmental and social impacts without compromising nutritional adequacy or access.", "children": [{"id": "314d0bc7-5445-4cb5-82f3-afbfea2be12f", "type": "concept", "title": "Plant-forward substitutions and lifecycle adequacy"}, {"id": "ec3fe20f-923a-4598-8a2a-7c4d675ad7c5", "type": "concept", "title": "Food waste, packaging, seasonality, and procurement"}, {"id": "e862a81d-9126-43fe-a2a4-444f19b9bd66", "type": "concept", "title": "Autonomy, equity, conflicts of interest, and evidence transparency"}]}]}], "dbBacked": true}$lcnjson$::jsonb,
