 maternal–infant dyad embedded in family, work, health, and policy contexts. Counseling supports informed feeding choices without coercion or shame.", "children": [{"id": "22d5fc28-01a8-4742-9b4c-3f83c16fab0d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Lactation physiology and requirements", "description": "Explain milk production, composition, and common nutrient considerations.", "children": [{"id": "cb28354d-94a4-498b-bb66-9e838c8c05fd", "type": "concept", "title": "Lactogenesis, supply–demand regulation, and milk composition"}, {"id": "bd2a1d97-1624-476f-8e25-d03c79f71143", "type": "concept", "title": "Energy, hydration, iodine, vitamin D, B12, choline, and DHA considerations"}, {"id": "92717e12-be29-494f-88d7-f3ef6299471e", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication, substance, and supplement referral resources"}]}, {"id": "468661ec-4aaf-481a-9ac3-8c301c6a5bd6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Feeding assessment and support", "description": "Evaluate transfer, comfort, growth, and family goals.", "children": [{"id": "2ab0974b-b230-4391-88ca-d115aa8cf949", "type": "concept", "title": "Latch, positioning, milk transfer, pumping, storage, and return to work"}, {"id": "34c5e470-d295-4cf1-b8bf-027822a2e780", "type": "concept", "title": "Low supply, oversupply, pain, mastitis concerns, and referral to lactation care"}, {"id": "3d8e0a55-c7fa-459a-9788-330cc7f74959", "type": "concept", "title": "Combination feeding, donor milk, formula, and safe preparation"}]}, {"id": "4393d432-e90a-4c10-af08-0d3f96c929ca", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Postpartum recovery", "description": "Address the nutrition and health of the postpartum person.", "children": [{"id": "9760ad99-711c-427c-a2f5-6f02b30e62a7", "type": "concept", "title": "Recovery, anemia, glycemic follow-up, sleep, and hydration"}, {"id": "0fcae43e-9515-46a8-972f-b4e4bd6fca46", "type": "concept", "title": "Mental health, body image, food access, and caregiving burden"}, {"id": "c0fbd956-6b66-4543-ba13-52be83f58bfa", "type": "concept",